      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GIVE ME BUCKS (8) boasts a strong record this journey with 17 wins and 18 minors from 45 tries. Missed the frame latest (19.37) when fifth over 350m at this track in a Free For All. Looks well placed and should feature. NOAKI WARRIOR (2) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 16.75 beating Go Gem Go. Has performed well from this box with a win and five minor placings to his name from 12 starts. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. FEDERAL EMERAN (1) has been in the placings at her last two runs, most recently when second (30.56) in a Mix 5 over 520m at Q Parklands. Can improve sharply here. LONE PILOT (3) is among the chances again if he runs up to the latest effort.",
